This file lists the licence of nmux and of each piece of software nmux bundles. nmux.app carries
every licence text in this folder:

    Contents/Resources/Licenses/

Each entry names the licence, its file in this repository, and its file in that folder:

- nmux itself: MIT. LICENSE, in the app as nmux-LICENSE.
- libghostty-vt and the code adapted from Ghostty at commit 22f100c6: MIT, by Mitchell Hashimoto
  and the Ghostty contributors. vendor/LICENSE-ghostty, in the app as ghostty-LICENSE.
- Symbols Nerd Font 3.4.0: MIT. Resources/Fonts/SymbolsNerdFont-LICENSE.txt,
  in the app as symbols-nerd-font-LICENSE.
- The Ghostty themes of iTerm2-Color-Schemes, at the commit in vendor/iTerm2-Color-Schemes/COMMIT:
  MIT. vendor/iTerm2-Color-Schemes/LICENSE, in the app as iterm2-color-schemes-LICENSE.
- Maple Mono: SIL Open Font License 1.1. Resources/Fonts/MapleMono-OFL.txt,
  in the app as maple-mono-OFL.
